# Sweep notes:
# U2: lib.rs has no mail_message_states schema test (table doesn't exist yet on U2); absent.
# U3: lib.rs has no mail_message_states schema test; absent.
# U4: lib.rs line ~1396 has the sqlite_schema_tracks_unified_message_state_and_roster_runtime_columns test.
#     The test checks mail_message_states columns: read, pending_ack_at, acknowledged_at, expires_at, deleted_at.
#     The test does NOT include assert!(!collected.iter().any(|column| column == "stale_at")) for mail_message_states.
